# ============================================
# 防止特殊物品被合成
# 阻止有自訂名稱的物品作為合成材料
# ============================================

# ============================================
# 方法 1：阻止所有有自訂名稱的物品被合成
# ============================================
on craft:
    loop items in crafting inventory of player:
        if name of loop-item is set:
            cancel event
            send "&c無法使用特殊物品進行合成！" to player
            play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 0.5 to player
            stop

